; RT24 / PT24 (#709), ADR 0047 and PT23/PT24 as updated by PR #836.
; Expectations come from independent arithmetic or stored AutoCAD blocks.
; No Tecnigrafo executable was used to derive these values.

; Suppress both dimension-line halves/arrows and center marks to isolate text.
; Explicit text position is a center, including with TAD=1; TOH/TIH select
; horizontal text according to whether the text is outside or inside.

